<title>THAILAND: Bangkok Bank wins stage agency bonds bid.</title>
<headline>Bangkok Bank wins stage agency bonds bid.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangkok Bank Plc, Thailand's largest bank, on Thursday won a bid to underwrite a total of 7.5 billion baht in bond issues made by three state enterprises, a finance ministry official said.</p>
</text>
